              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Curinn Carbone"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Stew is always a 'whatever I have' mosh pot in my kitchen. With that said I am rating this with a few substitutes but really do not think it changes the outcome except for minor personal tastes. I used raw apple cider vinegar instead of white vinegar, regular beer, no parsnips and added peas at the end. Absolutely loved it, had a reminisce flavor of sauerkraut which goes hand-in-hand with corned beef."
          },
