              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LoftyDill2836"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty, found that having the vegetables cubed before preparing the corn beef was very helpful, added an additional cup of water at the end to loosen up the thickness of the broth...served with Irish soda bread and an additional baked brisket...no leftovers at our table and expect it will be a family favorite ☘️",
