            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "apstory"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So hearty and filling!! I was looking for something other than the traditional corned beef and cabbage meal and stumbled upon this. It was amazing and I will definitely be putting it in my soup rotation. I did it to the letter except I have a hard time using water in any soup recipe, so I substituted a can of Campbell’s chicken broth (I know, I know…lots of sodium) and rinsed the can with a couple of ounces of water. You won’t be disappointed with this stew!",
            "datePublished": "2025-03-19T12:13:18.556Z"
